WEBVTT

00:06.540 --> 00:08.750
[indistinct shouting, clamoring]

00:09.880 --> 00:11.210
I'll accept

00:11.720 --> 00:14.300
that it was me who ruined BLACK DRAGON.

00:15.300 --> 00:18.140
But you've got to accept it too,

00:18.220 --> 00:20.720
that I'm not Akane!

00:20.810 --> 00:22.270
I'm Seishu!

00:22.770 --> 00:24.520
[gasps]

00:26.270 --> 00:27.610
[Kokonoi] Stop it.

00:28.650 --> 00:29.730
[grunts in pain]

00:29.860 --> 00:32.240
[panting]

00:32.940 --> 00:35.660
I… I…

00:37.200 --> 00:39.580
have lived for money.

00:41.830 --> 00:43.830
[♪ theme music playing]

02:11.500 --> 02:15.000
ASAYAMA LIBRARY

02:24.510 --> 02:25.600
What book is that?

02:26.430 --> 02:27.560
Money…

02:28.520 --> 02:30.020
[Kokonoi] It's about how to make money.

02:31.350 --> 02:33.230
I don't have nearly enough yet.

02:34.650 --> 02:37.440
You should go home once in a while.

02:38.610 --> 02:40.160
You're not like me, you know.

02:48.120 --> 02:50.330
[inhales deeply, sighs]

03:07.270 --> 03:08.390
Inupi.

03:08.930 --> 03:12.810
-[snoring softly]
-[wind gusting]

03:12.900 --> 03:15.150
[♪ pensive music playing]

03:19.990 --> 03:22.160
[exhales softly]

03:37.880 --> 03:40.550
[Kokonoi sobbing]

03:44.090 --> 03:45.220
Akane.

03:46.970 --> 03:47.970
[Akane] <i>Hajime!</i>

03:48.060 --> 03:49.720
-[hurried footsteps approaching]
-[Akane] Hajime!

03:49.810 --> 03:50.980
[both] Hmm?

03:51.560 --> 03:53.310
You're always with Seishu.

03:53.980 --> 03:55.190
Are you going home now?

03:55.270 --> 03:56.310
Yeah.

03:56.400 --> 03:57.940
-[♪ gentle music playing]
-[Kokonoi] <i>Akane Inui.</i>

03:58.020 --> 04:01.150
<i>She's Inupi's older sister by five years.</i>

04:01.240 --> 04:03.030
Want to go to the library?

04:03.110 --> 04:05.410
There's a book
I'd like you to read, Hajime.

04:05.490 --> 04:06.620
[soft grunt]

04:09.660 --> 04:11.330
I'll carry your stuff, Akane.

04:11.410 --> 04:13.790
That's okay. Thanks anyway.

04:14.370 --> 04:17.210
-[Kokonoi] <i>I always loved her.</i>
-You're always so nice, Hajime.

04:19.050 --> 04:20.380
You really shouldn't be.

04:20.460 --> 04:23.720
When you get a girlfriend,
don't be nice to other girls.

04:24.550 --> 04:26.220
Or else she'll get jealous.

04:26.840 --> 04:28.550
Because you're handsome, you know.

04:32.430 --> 04:33.560
[Inui yawns]

04:33.640 --> 04:35.900
[Akane] Seishu, you could learn
a thing or two from him.

04:35.980 --> 04:38.150
-[Inui] No thanks.
-[Akane laughs]

04:39.690 --> 04:41.570
[Inui] I'm going on ahead home.

04:41.650 --> 04:42.990
[Kokonoi] See you tomorrow.

04:43.070 --> 04:44.200
[Inui] Bye.

04:44.700 --> 04:46.570
[crow cawing in distance]

04:49.080 --> 04:51.540
Isn't this a book for adults?

04:52.410 --> 04:54.870
-Hmm?
-[snoring]

04:56.040 --> 04:57.460
[chuckles]

04:57.540 --> 05:00.130
[Kokonoi] <i>She invited me,
but now she's napping.</i>

05:00.210 --> 05:02.920
<i>And she's sound asleep
with a book for a pillow.</i>

05:08.800 --> 05:11.970
<i>She's got the same face as Inupi,
but she's so pretty.</i>

05:12.060 --> 05:14.060
[snoring continues]

05:15.890 --> 05:17.350
[soft grunt]

05:21.770 --> 05:24.150
[gulps, grunts]

05:32.160 --> 05:33.830
-[Akane] Don't you dare.
-[startled grunt]

05:36.080 --> 05:37.460
[shaky breath]

05:38.170 --> 05:41.210
[Akane]
You should only kiss someone you love.

05:41.290 --> 05:44.420
Yeah… Sorry. But…

05:44.960 --> 05:47.630
Akane… I'm…

05:48.760 --> 05:50.010
I'm in love with you.

05:53.100 --> 05:54.930
I'm five years older than you.

05:55.810 --> 05:57.140
That doesn't matter.

05:57.230 --> 05:59.900
When we grow up,
it won't be such a big gap.

06:01.650 --> 06:03.400
[soft chuckle]

06:03.480 --> 06:05.650
[♪ soft music playing]

06:09.950 --> 06:11.450
INUI

06:11.530 --> 06:13.120
[Akane] Thanks for seeing me home.

06:13.790 --> 06:14.790
See you later.

06:14.870 --> 06:17.000
-[Kokonoi] Akane.
-Hmm?

06:17.080 --> 06:20.040
I will love you forever.

06:20.120 --> 06:22.540
When I grow up, please marry me!

06:24.000 --> 06:25.300
[soft chuckle]

06:26.050 --> 06:27.170
I'll think about it.

06:27.760 --> 06:28.840
I'll protect you forever.

06:31.260 --> 06:32.470
Do you promise?

06:32.550 --> 06:35.430
Yeah. I promise.

06:36.560 --> 06:39.940
Okay. Then I'll wait
until you're grown up.

06:40.480 --> 06:42.860
[panting]

06:44.320 --> 06:46.150
[panting happily]

06:52.200 --> 06:55.200
I told her… my feelings for her.

06:56.990 --> 06:59.120
Oh, no! I've got to get home.

07:00.750 --> 07:02.290
Oh my. Look at that.

07:02.380 --> 07:05.130
-Dear me! Goodness gracious!
-[Kokonoi] Hmm?

07:05.210 --> 07:07.090
[resident] Could that be a fire?

07:07.630 --> 07:10.130
Over there… Could that be…

07:10.880 --> 07:12.760
-[fire crackling]
-[indistinct chatter]

07:12.840 --> 07:14.470
-[neighbor 1 gasps worriedly]
-[surprised grunt]

07:17.270 --> 07:18.890
[gasps]

07:18.980 --> 07:22.350
Where's the fire department?
Did the people inside come out?

07:22.440 --> 07:24.020
[neighbor 2] I don't know.

07:24.110 --> 07:25.310
I didn't see them.

07:25.400 --> 07:26.860
[neighbor 3]
I just called the fire department.

07:26.940 --> 07:29.570
[neighbor 2]
I don't think their parents are home yet.

07:29.650 --> 07:30.820
[Kokonoi] <i>Akane…</i>

07:32.320 --> 07:33.780
-[fire roaring]
-[neighbors exclaim in fear]

07:36.030 --> 07:38.240
-[neighbor 3] Hey! It's dangerous!
-[running footsteps]

07:38.330 --> 07:39.580
[grunts]

07:42.750 --> 07:43.960
[Kokonoi] <i>Akane.</i>

07:44.750 --> 07:47.130
[breathes heavily]
<i>Akane.</i>

07:48.500 --> 07:49.630
<i>Akane!</i>

07:49.710 --> 07:51.920
[fire crackling]

07:56.600 --> 07:58.060
[neighbor] He came out!

07:58.140 --> 07:59.600
[indistinct chatter]

08:03.560 --> 08:07.060
-[coughing]
-Akane, you're safe now.

08:07.570 --> 08:08.650
[Inui] No…

08:09.360 --> 08:10.900
-Koko.
-Huh?

08:11.570 --> 08:14.450
[pants]
I'm not Akane.

08:15.030 --> 08:18.080
-[Inui] I'm Seishu.
-[gasps, breathes shakily]

08:19.540 --> 08:20.790
-[firefighter 1] Hey, kid!
-[firefighter 2] Huh?

08:20.870 --> 08:23.250
-Akane! Akane!
-Stay back! It's dangerous!

08:23.330 --> 08:24.710
Akane!

08:24.790 --> 08:27.210
[Kokonoi shouts]
Akane!

08:27.290 --> 08:29.300
[♪ somber music playing]

08:33.470 --> 08:36.550
-I heard the doctor talking to my parents.
-[Kokonoi sobbing]

08:37.090 --> 08:38.100
Akane…

08:38.850 --> 08:40.640
-they barely managed to save her.
-[grunts]

08:41.810 --> 08:42.980
But…

08:44.020 --> 08:45.480
her burns are so bad…

08:46.190 --> 08:48.900
it'll take a ton of money to treat them.

08:49.770 --> 08:52.280
To get her as close as she was before,

08:52.990 --> 08:55.610
it'll cost 40 million yen.

08:56.410 --> 08:58.240
40 million?

08:58.870 --> 09:00.950
I don't think my parents can afford it.

09:02.120 --> 09:04.580
There's still a lot left
on their home loan.

09:05.500 --> 09:07.420
My dad just holds his head in his hands

09:07.880 --> 09:09.590
and my mom just cries and cries.

09:10.210 --> 09:12.460
I don't know what to do.

09:13.300 --> 09:14.550
[grunts, sniffles]

09:15.130 --> 09:17.510
-[Kokonoi] If you can't pay…
-Huh?

09:17.590 --> 09:20.810
[Kokonoi]
If you can't pay the 40 million yen,

09:21.220 --> 09:23.980
what will happen to Akane?
[breathing shakily]

09:24.520 --> 09:25.810
[in hoarse voice]
I don't know.

09:26.980 --> 09:29.940
I made a promise to Akane.

09:31.480 --> 09:33.320
I said I'd protect her forever.

09:35.650 --> 09:37.200
[Kokonoi] If Akane dies,

09:37.950 --> 09:39.320
I…

09:41.080 --> 09:42.370
[Kokonoi breathes shakily, sniffles]

09:43.290 --> 09:44.910
That 40 million…

09:46.370 --> 09:48.790
I'll make that much, even if it kills me.

09:51.630 --> 09:55.510
RETURNS

09:56.090 --> 10:00.970
[Kokonoi] <i>I wracked my brain
for ways to make money.</i>

10:01.050 --> 10:02.680
[♪ tense music playing]

10:02.760 --> 10:04.810
<i>I thought and thought,</i>

10:05.430 --> 10:08.690
<i>but for a kid like me
to make a heap of money in a short time…</i>

10:12.480 --> 10:14.610
<i>meant I'd have to turn to crime.</i>

10:17.950 --> 10:20.030
<i>I researched a ton
for illegal ways to make money.</i>

10:20.110 --> 10:21.160
[paper rustles]

10:21.910 --> 10:24.330
<i>First, I gathered several punk kids.</i>

10:24.410 --> 10:26.700
<i>I had them steal and extort.</i>

10:27.160 --> 10:29.370
[Kokonoi] Listen up, you punks.

10:30.170 --> 10:33.540
If you get caught,
it's because you don't have a proper plan.

10:34.090 --> 10:37.590
If you do just as I tell you,
you'll never get caught.

10:37.670 --> 10:41.470
I'll get you more money
than any kid ever could.

10:43.050 --> 10:44.890
[Kokonoi] <i>My plan was a huge success.</i>

10:45.510 --> 10:47.680
<i>The punk kids were overjoyed.</i>

10:48.890 --> 10:51.480
<i>Rumors about us spread,
and more of them gathered.</i>

10:52.560 --> 10:57.570
<i>In a single month,
I had a decent-sized band of thieves.</i>

10:58.490 --> 11:00.570
<i>But it was still just a gang of kids.</i>

11:01.160 --> 11:05.580
<i>No matter how much they scraped together,
it was a far cry from 40 million.</i>

11:06.330 --> 11:09.290
-Money… money… money…
-[laughter]

11:09.370 --> 11:12.830
-[passerby] Really? You'll buy me that?
-You better believe it.

11:12.920 --> 11:13.960
[passerby] Great! Then…

11:14.040 --> 11:15.920
[indistinct chatter]

11:16.000 --> 11:18.710
[Kokonoi]
<i>I used that few hundred thousand we made</i>

11:18.800 --> 11:20.510
<i>for a counterfeit credit card</i>

11:20.590 --> 11:22.970
-<i>and frequented a club's VIP room.</i>
-[♪ upbeat dance music playing]

11:23.680 --> 11:25.890
<i>I did it to connect with rich people.</i>

11:26.510 --> 11:27.810
[exhales deeply]

11:29.100 --> 11:31.140
So you're that kid I've heard about?

11:31.230 --> 11:35.110
Yes. I'll do whatever you want
as long as you make it worth my while.

11:35.190 --> 11:37.570
[scoffs]
Nice!

11:40.610 --> 11:44.820
There's a jerk I want you to threaten,
but don't quite kill him.

11:45.570 --> 11:47.160
[Kokonoi] <i>I came up with the idea</i>

11:47.240 --> 11:50.250
<i>to provide a crime-committing service
for the rich.</i>

11:50.710 --> 11:52.790
<i>It was the ideal business
since we'd get off easy</i>

11:52.870 --> 11:54.210
<i>even if we were caught.</i>

11:55.500 --> 11:57.840
<i>I had hit the mother lode.</i>

11:59.340 --> 12:01.720
-[inaudible]
-<i>Money, money, money.</i>

12:02.510 --> 12:03.840
<i>I was desperate.</i>

12:04.800 --> 12:06.510
-[cell phone ringing]
-Hmm?

12:08.760 --> 12:09.930
Hello?

12:10.020 --> 12:12.890
[Inui panting, breathing shakily]

12:15.150 --> 12:16.230
[voice breaking]
Akane…

12:17.650 --> 12:20.030
-[flatlining]
-<i>…is dead.</i>

12:20.110 --> 12:22.490
[inaudible]

12:24.570 --> 12:26.660
[shocked gasp]

12:28.950 --> 12:31.580
[indistinct shouting, clamoring]

12:31.660 --> 12:32.750
[Kokonoi grunts]

12:32.910 --> 12:34.870
[shouts]
Wake up, Koko!

12:34.960 --> 12:36.710
-Akane's already--
-Shut up!

12:37.460 --> 12:38.880
[grunts]

12:38.960 --> 12:41.300
Don't glare at me with that face!

12:41.380 --> 12:43.300
[grunts, gasps]

12:43.380 --> 12:44.430
[groans]

12:44.510 --> 12:46.430
-I did all sorts of things!
-[Inui grunting]

12:46.510 --> 12:47.760
Whatever they asked!

12:47.850 --> 12:50.060
-Anything that paid!
-[groans]

12:51.600 --> 12:53.890
-Then all kinds of people approached me.
-[♪ tense music playing]

12:53.980 --> 12:55.770
[Kokonoi] <i>Izana Kurokawa.</i>

12:55.850 --> 12:58.440
So you're that money-making genius.

12:58.520 --> 12:59.820
[Kokonoi] <i>Shion Madarame.</i>

13:00.270 --> 13:03.150
I'm the ninth leader, Madarame.

13:04.610 --> 13:06.110
[Kokonoi] <i>The Haitani Brothers.</i>

13:06.200 --> 13:07.620
We'll do business again.

13:07.700 --> 13:09.240
[Kokonoi] <i>Taiju Shiba.</i>

13:09.330 --> 13:12.500
Oh. You're smaller than I expected.

13:12.580 --> 13:13.790
[grunts in pain]

13:13.870 --> 13:16.420
Everyone who came to me
had a simple request.

13:16.870 --> 13:17.880
Money.

13:18.790 --> 13:20.840
It was the same with you, Inupi.

13:21.590 --> 13:26.760
Ultimately, you totally used me
to rebuild BLACK DRAGON.

13:26.840 --> 13:28.220
[inhales shakily]

13:28.300 --> 13:30.390
[voice breaking]
Come on, Koko.

13:30.470 --> 13:32.600
-Akane's--
-Shut up, Inupi.

13:33.560 --> 13:35.890
I don't need any feelings.

13:35.980 --> 13:38.480
Money's the only thing
everyone wants from me!

13:38.850 --> 13:40.190
[shouts]
That's all fine!

13:41.480 --> 13:43.980
[Kokonoi] I… can't go back.

13:44.610 --> 13:45.820
I can't stop.

13:46.780 --> 13:47.910
If I stop--

13:47.990 --> 13:49.620
[shouts, sobs]
Koko!

13:49.700 --> 13:51.410
Akane's dead!

13:54.450 --> 13:55.700
[♪ music fades]

13:55.790 --> 13:57.210
[Inui gasps]

13:58.080 --> 13:59.170
Akane…

14:00.460 --> 14:01.670
If you saw me now,

14:02.670 --> 14:04.710
would you scold me with this same look?

14:08.180 --> 14:10.680
[Kokonoi breathing shakily]

14:23.690 --> 14:24.900
Did it hurt?

14:28.530 --> 14:30.530
[Kokonoi]
You're finally at peace, aren't you?

14:32.490 --> 14:35.290
[Kokonoi sobs]
<i>Money. Money.</i>

14:35.910 --> 14:36.950
<i>Money.</i>

14:37.040 --> 14:38.790
[stifled sobbing]

14:39.920 --> 14:41.330
[voice breaking]
I'm sorry, Akane.

14:42.250 --> 14:45.630
-[♪ somber music playing]
-If only… I had more money…

14:46.210 --> 14:50.090
If only… I had more…
[sobs]

14:50.180 --> 14:53.510
[Kokonoi] More…
[sobbing]

14:54.350 --> 14:55.760
[Inui grunts]

14:57.600 --> 14:58.680
Koko…

14:58.770 --> 15:00.140
I know it!

15:01.270 --> 15:02.350
That Akane…

15:03.520 --> 15:04.520
is dead.

15:05.110 --> 15:06.320
But I…

15:07.610 --> 15:08.740
can't go back.

15:08.820 --> 15:10.070
[gasps]

15:10.150 --> 15:12.950
I've dedicated my life to Tenjiku now.

15:14.240 --> 15:16.490
You are my enemy.

15:17.450 --> 15:18.500
Koko…

15:19.710 --> 15:23.040
The regrets of others
always seem to be ugly.

15:24.380 --> 15:27.670
But I guess you know better than anyone.

15:28.380 --> 15:30.630
Isn't that right, Kokonoi?

15:31.930 --> 15:34.090
From now on, you're fighting me,

15:34.180 --> 15:35.220
Inui.

15:36.140 --> 15:37.560
[annoyed grunt]

15:37.680 --> 15:39.890
[indistinct shouting, clamoring]

15:40.850 --> 15:42.480
[shouts]

15:42.600 --> 15:43.690
[thwacks]

15:43.770 --> 15:44.940
[grunts]

15:45.900 --> 15:48.780
You're such a pushover, Takemichi.

15:49.440 --> 15:50.900
Is tough talk all you've got?

15:50.990 --> 15:51.990
[angry grunt]

15:55.280 --> 15:56.580
[Takemichi] Get out of the way, Kaku-chan.

15:57.080 --> 15:58.870
I'm here to fight Kisaki!

16:00.290 --> 16:03.120
Is there something between you two?

16:03.210 --> 16:05.210
I don't have time to explain it.

16:05.710 --> 16:08.090
Right now,
Kisaki is the brains behind Izana.

16:09.050 --> 16:12.050
As long as I'm here,
you'll never get to him.

16:12.130 --> 16:13.430
[Takemichi] <i>Damn it!</i>

16:13.510 --> 16:17.350
<i>Chifuyu, Akkun, and the others opened
the way for me, but I'm hopeless.</i>

16:18.970 --> 16:20.100
[Kisaki] Izana.

16:20.180 --> 16:22.730
Toman was supposed to be
on the verge of collapse,

16:22.810 --> 16:26.020
but Tenjiku sure seems to be struggling
against them.

16:27.440 --> 16:28.650
[gasps]

16:29.400 --> 16:30.400
Takemichi!

16:31.070 --> 16:32.650
-[grunts]
-[Chifuyu gasps]

16:32.740 --> 16:34.700
[Chifuyu grunts]

16:35.820 --> 16:37.490
Keep your head in the game!

16:38.870 --> 16:41.000
Out of my way, gorilla tank!

16:41.080 --> 16:43.160
Who the hell are you calling "gorilla"?

16:43.250 --> 16:44.420
[Chifuyu] <i>Damn it!</i>

16:44.500 --> 16:48.130
<i>I thought I lost the other day
because he sucker punched me,</i>

16:48.630 --> 16:51.090
<i>but this jerk's seriously strong!</i>

16:52.630 --> 16:54.050
When I was in juvie,

16:54.630 --> 16:56.340
I lost my temper and went berserk.

16:57.180 --> 16:59.760
[Izana] <i>I beat down
every last one of the other inmates,</i>

17:00.260 --> 17:02.980
<i>and guards who were there that day.</i>

17:03.480 --> 17:07.650
<i>But there were a few dudes
who wouldn't go down.</i>

17:08.810 --> 17:11.070
[Izana] By chance,
we were all 13 years old.

17:11.940 --> 17:14.030
That's the Vicious Generation.

17:14.700 --> 17:17.990
-[cracking]
-Mocchi's crime was obstruction of duty.

17:18.740 --> 17:22.160
He wiped out the gang
that controlled Kawasaki all by himself.

17:22.830 --> 17:25.660
[Hanma]
But how is that obstruction of duty?

17:26.250 --> 17:30.710
[Izana]
<i>He beat the crap out of the cops who came.</i>

17:31.920 --> 17:33.090
Pretty kick-ass, right?

17:33.920 --> 17:34.920
Awesome.

17:35.470 --> 17:37.680
[Izana] Mucho's crime was assault.

17:37.760 --> 17:38.760
Huh?

17:39.180 --> 17:41.890
That's pretty ordinary compared to Mocchi.

17:42.350 --> 17:45.810
[Izana] The guy he beat up was
a has-been mixed martial artist yakuza.

17:46.440 --> 17:48.850
He busted his spine
and turned him into a paraplegic.

17:48.940 --> 17:50.810
-[Hanma] Huh? Did he hit him with a car?
-[shouts]

17:51.520 --> 17:53.610
He slammed him into the concrete.

17:53.690 --> 17:54.740
[surprised grunt]

17:55.360 --> 17:56.610
-[grunts]
-[Inui groans]

17:56.700 --> 17:58.360
Judo, huh?

17:58.450 --> 17:59.910
[coughs, grunts in pain]

17:59.990 --> 18:02.490
You can't stand up now, Inui.

18:03.370 --> 18:05.750
[both panting]

18:06.410 --> 18:08.710
Is your arm okay, Angry?

18:08.790 --> 18:10.330
I think it's busted.

18:10.830 --> 18:12.420
Thanks for your concern.

18:12.500 --> 18:15.380
[Ran's brother]
Hey now, what are you so scared of?

18:15.800 --> 18:17.050
Come at me already.

18:17.550 --> 18:19.840
But it won't just be your arm next time.

18:20.680 --> 18:25.310
Ran, these two thought I was weak
just because I'm the younger brother.

18:25.720 --> 18:28.890
Then you'd better
teach them a lesson, Rindo.

18:29.440 --> 18:32.020
[Izana] The Haitani Brothers' crime
was manslaughter.

18:32.480 --> 18:33.650
[Hanma] I know that story.

18:34.150 --> 18:36.860
It was
that famous Roppongi Hai-Maniac War.

18:37.780 --> 18:42.320
[Izana] <i>At the time, the biggest gang
in Tokyo was Roppongi Max Maniacs.</i>

18:42.410 --> 18:46.790
<i>The Haitani Brothers fought
their two leaders one-on-one.</i>

18:47.290 --> 18:50.460
<i>The older brother, Ran,
took down the leader in an instant.</i>

18:50.540 --> 18:53.710
<i>He barged in on his brother Rindo's fight
with their vice-leader.</i>

18:54.210 --> 18:57.590
<i>While Rindo pinned the vice-leader
in a joint lock,</i>

18:58.130 --> 19:00.130
<i>Ran pounded his face more than necessary.</i>

19:00.590 --> 19:03.010
<i>His face was caved in.</i>

19:03.100 --> 19:06.350
<i>He was taken to the hospital
with a fractured skull,</i>

19:06.430 --> 19:07.770
<i>but before long, he died.</i>

19:08.520 --> 19:12.690
[Hanma] <i>So the Haitani Brothers
ruled Roppongi at age 13, huh?</i>

19:13.020 --> 19:14.820
We don't need no gang.

19:15.690 --> 19:18.030
The Haitani Brothers control Roppongi.

19:18.940 --> 19:21.280
[Izana]
Tenjiku has the Vicious Generation.

19:22.660 --> 19:25.410
No matter how much Toman struggles,
it's useless.

19:26.290 --> 19:29.200
Tenjiku will win this battle.

19:31.170 --> 19:35.090
Let's show them
how much more experienced we are.

19:35.170 --> 19:37.550
Don't get so worked up, Rindo.

19:37.630 --> 19:38.920
[annoyed grunt]

19:39.010 --> 19:41.840
Those brothers,
their moves are a pain in the ass.

19:41.930 --> 19:43.220
Yeah.

19:43.300 --> 19:45.680
Their synergy is intense.

19:46.350 --> 19:48.680
[surprised grunt]
Angry and Hakkai?

19:49.180 --> 19:51.140
That's a hell of a team.

19:51.230 --> 19:54.020
Next, I'm going for your leg!

19:54.100 --> 19:57.020
[Hakkai] <i>I've got to do something
to mess up their rhythm.</i>

19:57.110 --> 19:58.190
[Hakkai shouts]

19:59.480 --> 20:01.110
-Hakkai!
-[Hakkai] Ran's coming!

20:02.150 --> 20:03.740
[Souya grunts]

20:03.860 --> 20:06.580
[Souya] <i>When Rindo distracted me,
Ran came in!</i>

20:06.660 --> 20:08.410
-Angry!
-You left yourself open.

20:08.490 --> 20:09.490
[gasps]

20:10.620 --> 20:11.620
[Hakkai grunts]

20:12.120 --> 20:17.500
I know exactly how I should twist joints
to make people scream.

20:17.590 --> 20:19.460
[Hakkai] <i>Damn it! I let my guard down!</i>

20:19.550 --> 20:22.630
-[cracks]
-[screams in pain]

20:22.720 --> 20:24.840
-[clangs]
-[♪ intense music playing]

20:24.930 --> 20:27.760
[both panting]

20:27.850 --> 20:28.930
[Ran] These guys…

20:29.310 --> 20:31.520
They're Smiley's younger brother…

20:31.600 --> 20:33.730
[Rindo] And Taiju Shiba's younger brother.

20:33.810 --> 20:35.600
They've got zero synergy.

20:35.690 --> 20:36.770
Weak ass.

20:37.560 --> 20:41.650
[Souya] <i>Rindo's joint-lock technique
and Ran's baton assaults.</i>

20:42.190 --> 20:44.610
[Hakkai] <i>These two are a deadly combo.</i>

20:44.700 --> 20:47.910
Just when I thought
I got a read on Rindo's moves.

20:48.330 --> 20:50.330
You have to watch my moves, Hakkai!

20:50.410 --> 20:52.080
You said you got a read on him?

20:52.660 --> 20:53.830
Why didn't you tell me?

20:53.910 --> 20:55.670
I've been giving you the signal!

20:55.750 --> 20:56.750
Like this, see?

20:56.830 --> 21:00.090
How the heck am I supposed to see that?
Tell me when!

21:00.170 --> 21:02.380
Eye contact is faster!

21:02.460 --> 21:04.970
You call that a wink?

21:05.380 --> 21:06.640
[both] Aw, man.

21:06.720 --> 21:09.140
-Smiley would totally get it.
-Yuzuha would totally get it.

21:09.220 --> 21:10.350
[both] Huh?

21:10.430 --> 21:15.310
You little…
Did you even hear what you just said, huh?

21:15.390 --> 21:18.520
And what the hell are you doing
leaning on your big sis, huh?

21:18.610 --> 21:21.480
I knew it. Those two…

21:21.570 --> 21:24.700
[Chifuyu]
They are both spoiled youngest kids.

21:25.530 --> 21:26.570
Out of my way!

21:26.660 --> 21:27.660
You get out of mine!

21:27.740 --> 21:29.530
-[both gasp, grunt]
-[thwacks]

21:31.080 --> 21:35.160
Next time, bring your big brothers,
you sulky little mooches.

21:35.250 --> 21:37.670
Go hide in your brothers' shadow.

21:37.750 --> 21:40.630
[both panting]

21:40.710 --> 21:43.630
Those Haitani Brothers
are insanely strong.

21:43.710 --> 21:45.470
Not just strong, but sneaky.

21:45.970 --> 21:47.380
They could be unbeatable.

21:47.470 --> 21:49.470
They called you a mooch.

21:50.050 --> 21:51.350
You too.

21:51.720 --> 21:54.310
They told you to hide
in your brother's shadow.

21:54.390 --> 21:55.560
You too.

21:56.270 --> 21:58.770
We're actually pretty alike.

21:58.850 --> 22:00.560
You may be right.

22:00.650 --> 22:02.020
[both grunt]

22:02.110 --> 22:04.280
[Hakkai and Souya] Wait right there!

22:04.360 --> 22:05.440
[both] Huh?

22:05.900 --> 22:07.030
We're…

22:07.110 --> 22:08.950
The little brother alliance!

22:09.030 --> 22:10.450
-Huh?
-What?

22:10.530 --> 22:15.250
[both] We'll show you our pride
in relying on others!

22:16.000 --> 22:18.000
[♪ closing theme music playing]

23:44.710 --> 23:46.710
Translated by Brian Athey
